# Real password digests this repository may use, and what each is the
# MD5 of.
#
# Every other 32-digit value in the tree is invented, and says so: it is
# xxxx7e577e57c0dexxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx, a uuid without its hyphens (see
# CLAUDE.md), made with tools/new-id --hash.  That holds for a $1$
# password digest, a login's mac and its id0 alike, and tools/check-identities
# refuses anything else.
#
# Only a digest a test works out from a string it names belongs here,
# never one captured from a login.
$1$acbd18db4cc2f85cedef654fccc4a4d8	MD5 of "foo", the digest cmd/slhash/main_test.go checks slhash against
